# Anlogic device configuration
#

config ANLOGIC_ETHLITE
	tristate "Anlogic 10/100 Ethernet Lite support"

	help
	  This option enables support for the Anlogic 10/100 Ethernet Lite
	  controller. If you have a board with an Anlogic Ethernet Lite
	  controller, say Y or M here to include support for it in your
	  kernel. If unsure, say N.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	  will be called anlogic_ethlite.

	  This driver provides 10/100 Mbps Ethernet support and is suitable
	  for Anlogic FPSoC that feature the Ethernet Lite controller. It
	  supports both half-duplex and full-duplex modes, as well as a
	  variety of network protocols.
